    "content": {
      "rendered": "<h2></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Annual Benefit Report Year 2024</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><em>We are a purpose-driven organization that believes digital and technology companies can and should do more to create a positive impact in society.</em></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3369\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"850\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-200x300.jpg 200w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-scaled.jpg 1708w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 567px) 100vw, 567px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Get Lagos Now </strong>is a results driven, reliable team of experts that takes a 360 approach to your digital success locally and globally since 2010, while staying dedicated to helping make an effective impact on the elevation of local homelessness. 5%+ of all in-cash and in-kind donation of all business profits will continue to be donated to local non-profits yearly. <a href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/e-recycling/\">E-RecylingPDX.com</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3457 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural-300x225.jpeg 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3446 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1024x488.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 761px) 100vw, 761px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1024x488.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-300x143.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-768x366.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1536x732.png 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block.png 1544w\" alt=\"\" width=\"761\" height=\"363\" /></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2710 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 230px) 100vw, 230px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png 597w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo-300x232.png 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"177\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>B Corp Certified – We’re a new kind of business that balances purpose and profit. We make legal, financial, decisions, and actions required to consider the impact Get Lagos Now makes on the decisions of our workers, customers, suppliers, community, and the environment using our business as a force for good.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-2687 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 149px) 100vw, 149px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good.png 800w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good-300x296.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good-768x757.png 768w\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"147\" /></p>\n<div id=\"wayp-4135\" class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element small-10 columns small-centered prk_9_em wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_verve_fade_waypoint verve_fade_waypoint wpb_start_animation\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"extra_pad prk_inner_block columns small-centered clearfix\">\n<div class=\"vrv_outer_row\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-9 columns vc_column_container wpb_column\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p class=\"vc_custom_heading\"> BCFG Certified – Our aim is to maintain a culture that aligns with the Benefit Corporation philosophy. <em>Benefit Corporations for Good</em> assessed our values and performance to ensure we’re operating within the standards of a Benefit Corporation. Our authenticity, accountability, messaging and diversity is high. Overall, we are in alignment with the principles and operate with the best interests of our employees, customers, communities and the environment.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4189 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/info-2025-BCFG-1024x715.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"682\" height=\"476\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/info-2025-BCFG-1024x715.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/info-2025-BCFG-300x209.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/info-2025-BCFG-768x536.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/info-2025-BCFG-1536x1072.png 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/info-2025-BCFG.png 1698w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px\" /></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>In-Kind Donations</strong></h2>\n<h3>In 2024 the<strong> 5th Annual E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> was held at the non-profit <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rose Haven,</a> on Sept. 7th from 10am – 4p.  More details can be found at both <strong><a href=\"http://e-recyclingpdx.com/\">E-RecyclingPDX.com.</a></strong></h3>\n</div>\n<h3>In 2024 we’re happy to announce that <strong><a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rosehaven.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1641970828269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07V0jr-SSR4FenOtDXW13d\">Rose Haven</a></strong> received<span style=\"color: #0b5394;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">  3 I-pads and 3 cellphones.</span></b></span></h3>\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">Raphael House </a></strong>received <span style=\"color: #333399;\"><strong>4 Laptops and 1 Chromebook</strong></span> . All refurbishing was completed by <a href=\"https://strategicitpro.com/\">Strategic IT</a> – a Windows certified IT company in Portland, Oregon.</h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\"><strong>Blanchet House </strong></a>received <b><span style=\"color: #0b5394;\">3 laptops and two I-Pads to Blanchet House </span></b>to be given to residents in the process of job search efforts and staff as needed.</h3>\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\">New Avenues for Youth </a></strong>received <span style=\"color: #333399;\"><strong>6</strong></span><b><span style=\"color: #0b5394;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333399;\"> laptops </span></strong></span></b>to be given to youth in the process of job search, educational efforts and staff supply as needed.</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦<span id=\"ariaLabel58148b880cb33ed968b2\" class=\"v6-visually-hidden\">recycle and give back ✦</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Testimonials</strong></h2>\n<h3 class=\"preFade fadeIn\">Angelique* has been taking classes for some time and her computer broke. She needed a computer to be able to complete assignments. She’s able to keep working toward completing her degree with a donated computer. <a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Raphael House</em></a><em> resident recipient.</em></h3>\n<h3 class=\"preFade fadeIn\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"preFade fadeIn\">&#8220;Thanks to a donated laptop an employee of <a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blanchet House </a>could participate remotely in professional development training. Improving their access to technology kept them from missing out on learning important skills to better serve our clients.&#8221; &#8212;<em>Blanchet House Staff</em></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<section id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_244\" class=\"page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle light-bold\" data-test=\"page-section\" data-section-theme=\"light-bold\" data-section-id=\"660f30273882f24d886a8e19\" data-controller=\"SectionWrapperController\" data-current-styles=\"{ &quot;imageOverlayOpacity&quot;: 0.15, &quot;backgroundWidth&quot;: &quot;background-width--full-bleed&quot;, &quot;sectionHeight&quot;: &quot;section-height--custom&quot;, &quot;customSectionHeight&quot;: 0, &quot;horizontalAlignment&quot;: &quot;horizontal-alignment--center&quot;, &quot;verticalAlignment&quot;: &quot;vertical-alignment--middle&quot;, &quot;contentWidth&quot;: &quot;content-width--wide&quot;, &quot;customContentWidth&quot;: 50, &quot;backgroundColor&quot;: &quot;&quot;, &quot;sectionTheme&quot;: &quot;light-bold&quot;, &quot;sectionAnimation&quot;: &quot;none&quot;, &quot;backgroundMode&quot;: &quot;image&quot; }\" data-current-context=\"{ &quot;video&quot;: { &quot;playbackSpeed&quot;: 0.5, &quot;filter&quot;: 1, &quot;filterStrength&quot;: 0, &quot;zoom&quot;: 0, &quot;videoSourceProvider&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }, &quot;backgroundImageId&quot;: null, &quot;backgroundMediaEffect&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }, &quot;divider&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: false }, &quot;typeName&quot;: &quot;page&quot; }\" data-animation=\"none\" data-fluid-engine-section=\"\" data-controllers-bound=\"SectionWrapperController\" data-active=\"true\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_243\" class=\"content-wrapper\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_242\" class=\"content\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_241\" data-fluid-engine=\"true\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_240\" class=\"fluid-engine fe-660f30273882f24d886a8e18\">\n<div class=\"fe-block fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1741637398686_6462\">\n<div id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1741637398686_6462\" class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-blend-mode=\"NORMAL\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"{&quot;topLeft&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;topRight&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;bottomRight&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0}}\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\">\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Thanks to you, survivors like Amara* are busy planning their futures.</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">More than 13 years ago, Amara came to live in our emergency shelter with her three children, just days after giving birth. Amara worked hard to rebuild her new life as a single mom, and with support from her advocate, connected to long-term, stable housing.</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">After moving into a safe apartment of their own, Amara and her children continued to connect with Raphael House through our Advocacy Center – accessing ongoing services, weekly support groups, and family activities. Over the years, our advocates were able to help Amara in winning full legal custody of her children, receive a work permit and driver’s license, and start a small business of her own.</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Just last year, Amara finally received her US residency card, paving her way to applying for permanent citizenship. Her residency card will also allow her to return to her home country, and visit her mother for the first time in over 24 years – and she is working to renew her children’s passports, so that they can plan the trip together as a family.</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><strong>Your generous gift of an HP laptop and clothing is making a difference here, </strong>and funding transformative programs so that survivors like Amara can <em>thrive</em>. Thank you for helping us envision a brighter future, where change like this is possible for the families we serve!</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Warm wishes,</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Emmy Ritter, MSW (she/her)</span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><em>Executive Director</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><a href=\"mailto:eritter@raphaelhouse.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">eritter@raphaelhouse.com</a></span></p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">(503) 243-5119</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_239\" class=\"fe-block fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1741638394719_3621\">\n<div id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1741638394719_3621\" class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-stretched sqs-text-ready\" data-block-type=\"5\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_238\" class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_237\" class=\"image-block-outer-wrapper layout-caption-below design-layout-fluid image-position-center combination-animation-site-default individual-animation-site-default sqs-narrow-width animation-loaded\" data-test=\"image-block-fluid-outer-wrapper\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_236\" class=\"fluid-image-animation-wrapper sqs-image sqs-block-alignment-wrapper preSlide slideIn\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_235\" class=\"fluid-image-container sqs-image-content\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_234\" class=\"content-fit\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 12.5vw\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png?format=2500w 2500w\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"197\" data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/660f1e0e2aef32399a469771/8af79308-242a-4240-8fe1-a3d38b65bafa/emmypng.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"500x508\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" data-load=\"false\" data-loader=\"sqs\" /></p>\n<div class=\"fluidImageOverlay\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_260\" class=\"page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle bright\" data-test=\"page-section\" data-section-theme=\"bright\" data-section-id=\"660f30273882f24d886a8e1f\" data-controller=\"SectionWrapperController\" data-current-styles=\"{ &quot;imageOverlayOpacity&quot;: 0.15, &quot;backgroundWidth&quot;: &quot;background-width--full-bleed&quot;, &quot;sectionHeight&quot;: &quot;section-height--custom&quot;, &quot;customSectionHeight&quot;: 0, &quot;horizontalAlignment&quot;: &quot;horizontal-alignment--center&quot;, &quot;verticalAlignment&quot;: &quot;vertical-alignment--middle&quot;, &quot;contentWidth&quot;: &quot;content-width--wide&quot;, &quot;customContentWidth&quot;: 50, &quot;backgroundColor&quot;: &quot;&quot;, &quot;sectionTheme&quot;: &quot;bright&quot;, &quot;sectionAnimation&quot;: &quot;none&quot;, &quot;backgroundMode&quot;: &quot;image&quot; }\" data-current-context=\"{ &quot;video&quot;: { &quot;playbackSpeed&quot;: 0.5, &quot;filter&quot;: 1, &quot;filterStrength&quot;: 0, &quot;zoom&quot;: 0, &quot;videoSourceProvider&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }, &quot;backgroundImageId&quot;: null, &quot;backgroundMediaEffect&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }, &quot;divider&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: false }, &quot;typeName&quot;: &quot;page&quot; }\" data-animation=\"none\" data-fluid-engine-section=\"\" data-controllers-bound=\"SectionWrapperController\" data-active=\"true\">\n<div class=\"section-border\">\n<div class=\"section-background\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_259\" class=\"content-wrapper\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_258\" class=\"content\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_257\" data-fluid-engine=\"true\">\n<div id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1743444662387_256\" class=\"fluid-engine fe-660f30273882f24d886a8e1e\">\n<div class=\"fe-block fe-block-58148b880cb33ed968b2\">\n<div id=\"block-58148b880cb33ed968b2\" class=\"sqs-block marquee-block sqs-block-marquee preSlide slideIn\" data-blend-mode=\"NORMAL\" data-block-type=\"70\" data-border-radii=\"{&quot;topLeft&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;topRight&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;bottomRight&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0}}\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n<div class=\"Marquee\" data-ready=\"true\">\n<div class=\"Marquee-display fade-edges\">\n<div class=\"Marquee-measure\">\n<p class=\"Marquee-item Marquee-item--text\">\n</div>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\">recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦recycle and give back✦<span id=\"ariaLabel58148b880cb33ed968b2\" class=\"v6-visually-hidden\">recycle and give back ✦</span></p>\n<div class=\"Marquee-track\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fe-block fe-block-31647cd5166ec31b63d8\">\n<div id=\"block-31647cd5166ec31b63d8\" class=\"sqs-block horizontalrule-block sqs-block-horizontalrule\" data-block-type=\"47\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color\">Cash Donation &amp; Equipment Donations</span></strong></h2>\n<h3> 19.6% of total company profits were donated to local non-profits in both cash and new technology donations.</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h2><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color\">Volunteerism &amp; Board Leadership</span></strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Volunteer Hours – </strong>The <strong>Get Lagos Now Team</strong> had a total of 87 hrs. in volunteerism recorded supporting Portland, Oregon non-profits. Currently the Founder &amp; Managing CEO, Michelle Lagos, also serves on the <strong><a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\">Blanchet House</a> </strong>– Board of Directors.</h3>\n<h3><strong>Volunteer Driving Miles – </strong>The Get Lagos Now Team drove a total of 191 miles in volunteer miles in 2024.</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3907 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"727\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-768x512.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 727px) 100vw, 727px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
